<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Apple South said cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Apple South said cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney downgraded Apple South Inc to neutral from buy, a Smith Barney source said.</p>
<p>-- The analyst was not available for comment.</p>
<p>-- The stock tumbled eight to 12-7/8 Wednesday after warning of an earnings shortfall.  </p>
<p>-- also, Raymond James said it cut the stock to accumulate from buy.</p>
</text>
